{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The powered USB hub fits my recent computer accessories because it could connect my keyboard, card readers, and Ethernet adapter in one practical setup.",
    "Extra microSD cards feel useful for separate Raspberry Pi setups without overwriting my existing card. The HDMI and Ethernet cables also match equipment I use, although I have already bought cables recently."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks, Echo Dot, and smart plug do not address the computer setup and maintenance needs behind my recent purchases. Buying electronics does not mean I currently want streaming or voice-controlled devices.",
    "The full-size SD card resembles storage I have bought, but the physical format matters: my Raspberry Pi and recent GPS storage needs point to microSD. More HDMI and Ethernet cables are also less compelling when my recent purchases may already cover those needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seem to treat interest in computer accessories as interest in home electronics generally, despite the different purposes those devices serve.",
    "They seem to assume that buying a cable or memory card means I want another similar item, without enough attention to whether it adds a useful capability or duplicates what I just bought."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Ethernet adapter, cable pack, headphone mount, and blower duster suggest I am connecting, organizing, and maintaining a computer workspace.",
    "Compatibility and a distinct next use matter to me: a powered hub could support several accessories, and extra microSD cards could support separate projects, while the wrong card format or redundant cables offer less immediate value."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly recognized my computer accessory needs but stretched that interest too far into streaming and home automation while missing compatibility and recent purchases that may already meet a need."
}"}
